      },
      "description": "Removes the store's leftovers (temp files past a day, a crashed create's staging, derived values of older versions, what an upgrade left) and never an object or a changeset; dry_run lists them only. E_MAINTENANCE_BUSY while another gc, repair or upgrade runs: retry.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "description": "`gc`: remove the store's leftovers (temp files past a day, a crashed create's staging,\nderived values of older versions, what an upgrade left of the format before). It removes no\nobject and no changeset.",
        "properties": {
