      "description": "Lands a workspace's chain on its target. With your own shell, ws_rebase, build and test in the workspace, then ws_land with mode exact, which publishes only if the target has not moved since the rebase, so that the landed tree is the one you tested; check runs a command here instead, and blocks this server while it runs.",
      "inputSchema": {
        "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
        "description": "`ws_land` (client-side): land a workspace's chain on its target; with a check, rebase, run\nthe check there, and publish only the tree the check ran on.",
        "properties": {
          "check": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "description": "The check a workspace's land runs.",
                "properties": {
                  "argv": {
                    "description": "The command and its arguments, run without a shell in the workspace; when omitted, the\nrepository's `.swarmops/workspaces.json` `check.argv`.",
                    "items": {
